This software ("StoryFlow Dungeons Lab Free", the "Module") is a module for Foundry
Virtual Tabletop, distributed free of charge for use in tabletop role-playing games
run on the Foundry Virtual Tabletop platform.

## Permitted use

You are granted a free, non-exclusive license to:
  - Download, install, and use this Module, unmodified, in any number of
    Foundry Virtual Tabletop worlds, for personal or commercial game-running
    purposes (e.g. paid game-mastering services).
  - Author, use, and share your own StoryFlow graphs, quests, traders, and other
    content created with the Module. Content you author is yours.
  - Report bugs, request features, and submit patches via the project's
    issue tracker or the Dungeons Lab Discord.

