## Artwork and media assets

All files under `assets/images/` are original works created by Dungeons Lab and
are protected by copyright. They are licensed to you **only** as an inseparable
part of this Module, for use inside the Module itself. They are not free assets,
not public domain, and not an asset pack.

This applies in particular to:

  - **The animated dragon** (`assets/images/guide/` - the `.webm` animation
    frames and their accompanying stills). You may NOT extract, rip, export,
    re-encode, re-upload, resell, sublicense, redistribute, or otherwise
    separate this asset from the Module, whether on its own, as part of an
    asset pack, in another module, module template, game, video, stream
    overlay, NFT, dataset, or any other product - free or paid. Using it as
    a source for, or as training data in, generative-AI models is likewise
    prohibited. This restriction applies to the asset **individually**, even
    where redistribution of the Module as a whole might otherwise be discussed.

  - **The Dungeons Lab logo** (`assets/images/dungeons-lab-logo-256.png` and any
    other Dungeons Lab logo, wordmark, or branding contained in the Module).
    The logo was created by Dungeons Lab and is our copyrighted work and our
    trademark. It may not be copied, modified, recolored, redrawn, or used to
    identify, endorse, or brand any product, service, module, or community
    other than Dungeons Lab's own, without prior written permission.

Unmodified in-game use of these assets while running the Module is permitted.
Screenshots and video of the Module in normal use (reviews, tutorials, actual
plays, streams) are permitted and encouraged. Everything else requires prior
written permission from Dungeons Lab.

